<title>TURKEY: Turkish wholesale prices up 5.1 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Turkish wholesale prices up 5.1 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish wholesale prices rose 5.1 percent in September, up from 3.8 percent a month ago, the State Institute of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said consumer prices rose 6.1 percent in September from 4.8 percent in August.  </p>
<p>Year-on-year wholesale prices rose 79.8 percent in September, up slightly from August's 79.0 percent. The year-on-year consumer price rise was 79.3 percent, down from 81.9 percent in August.</p>
</text>
